cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "contract-orbit-views: the orbit-view standard and its checker"
abstract: >
  What an orbit-view bundle is in the Weftspun workspace: a still sheet (OpenEXR) or a
  clip (CineForm and FLAC in Matroska), a .cff and a per-view metrics table
  sharing one stem, every camera taken from sphere_hammersley_sequence.
  check_orbit_views.py checks the name, the media, the citation fields and every
  view against the sequence.
authors:
